10
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:12,666
Kiki's Delivery Service is a 1989 Japanese animated fantasy film written, produced, and directed
by Hayao Miyazaki, based on Eiko Kadono's 1985 novel Kiki's Delivery Service.

11
00:34:13,333 --> 00:34:19,333
Animated by Studio Ghibli, the film stars Minami Takayama,
Rei Sakuma, Kappei Yamaguchi, and Keiko Toda.

12
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:26,000
The story follows Kiki (Takayama), a young witch who moves to the port city of
Koriko with her cat Jiji (Sakuma) and starts a flying courier service.

13
00:40:26,666 --> 00:40:32,666
In 1987, Group Fudosha asked Kadono's publishers for the rights to the novel
to be made into a film by either Miyazaki or Isao Takahata.

14
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:39,333
Production began near the release of My Neighbor Totoro (1988).

15
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Miyazaki initially worked as producer, but took over directing from
Sunao Katabuchi as he became more involved in the project.

16
00:49:46,666 --> 00:49:52,666
As the novel is based on a fictional northern European country, Miyazaki and his team
traveled to locations such as Visby, Sweden, to research its landscape.

17
00:52:53,333 --> 00:52:59,333
Miyazaki altered the story, adding new scenes to emphasize
the theme of independence and growing up.

18
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
According to Miyazaki, the film portrays the gulf between
independence and reliance among teenage Japanese girls.

19
00:59:06,666 --> 00:59:12,666
Kiki's Delivery Service was released in Japan on July 29, 1989, by Toei.

20
01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
It was the first Studio Ghibli film to be successful on initial
release, grossing a total of ¥4.3 billion ($31 million).

21
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
It received critical acclaim and multiple awards.

22
01:08:26,666 --> 01:08:32,666
An English dub was produced by Streamline Pictures for
Japan Airlines international flights in 1989.

23
01:11:33,333 --> 01:11:39,333
The Walt Disney Studios produced an English dub in 1997, which became the first film
under a deal between Tokuma and Disney to be released in English.

24
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
It was released to home media in 1998.

25
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
The film explores themes of winter, minnesota, wilderness, slacker, salesman.

26
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
The tone is intense.
